  <div id="custom-impact-wrapper" class="custom-popups-wrapper">
    <span class="close-button" id="close-button-impact">X</span>
    <h2 class="h2">Impact</h2>

    {% if product.metafields.custom.impact == "Black Diamond" %}
      <p class="h5">SALLY SKOUFIS Jewelry: consciously crafted pieces inspired by environmental evolution and sustainable materiality.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Sally plays with ideas of light and dark, and the balance between the two. Black Diamonds, rather than flawless diamonds, are a signature stone in her pieces. Paying homage to luxury while rebelling against its conventions. She believes that women can draw strength from the difference their purchase power makes to the environment. </p>
        <p>“I work to illuminate the natural beauty of precious and semi-precious stones, but also that of man-made materials,” she says. “It is an invitation for women to explore their own sense of self through the expression of their style choices. Any decision that they make has impact, so let it be a positive one.”</p>
        <p>With her Signature embedded single Black Diamond as a provocative symbol of change, her choices have been intentional, paying homage to luxury whilst breaking ground in the industry in order to create lasting impact for communities and the environment. Her work provides an invitation to be drawn into greater meaning that sits behind the beauty and mystique of its materiality.</p>
        <p>100% of the proceeds from the SALLY SKOUFIS(™) signature Black Diamond, elegantly featured in this cherished piece, is donated to cause.</p>
      </div>
    {% elsif product.metafields.custom.impact == "Queen Bee" %}
      <p class="h5">Consciously hand crafted jewelry inspired by environmental evolution and sustainable materiality.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Honouring the immeasurable importance of bees and the role they possess in the preservation or destruction of life; Sally explores her craft with an opportunity to pioneer and create change, working to continually refine and develop creative and sustainable processes, expressing her designs across all material mediums - a combination of fine, semi-precious, and man-made materials. Her work provides an invitation to be drawn into the greater meaning that lies behind the beauty and mystique of its materiality.</p>
        <p>Proceeds from the SALLY SKOUFIS™ Queen Bee range are donated to preserve our bee species.</p>
      </div>
    
    {% elsif product.metafields.custom.impact == "Recycled Aluminium" %}
      <p class="h5">Nine months in the making, ANAX {Dragonfly} is the fulfilment of a pioneering collaboration of elite international craftsmen creating a new form of metal constituent in fine jewelry making – Recycled Aluminium.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>A revolutionary collection developed from refined soda cans to mark Sally’s quest for conscious innovation to industry practices.</p>
        <p>The result is a wholly conscious collection of mini sculptural pieces with fine detailing in vivid hues not otherwise available. The Dragonfly has been a symbol of hope, new beginnings and change for many centuries. </p>
        <p>ANAX is an ancient Greek word for leader. In a world desperate for sustainable evolution, Sally is incredibly grateful to share this pioneering endeavour with you. As one of the first sustainable alternatives in traditional fine jewelry making, SALLY SKOUFIS™ is honored to release ANAX: a breakthrough in conscious jewelry innovation and design edge.  </p>
      </div>
    {% elsif product.metafields.custom.impact == "Pearl" %}
      <p class="h5">ECLIPSE is a limited edition and Pre-Order collection to conserve our only 'living gemstones'.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Sally explores her craft with an opportunity to pioneer and create change, working to continually refine and develop creative and sustainable processes, expressing her designs across all material mediums - pearls are the only gemstone born from living creatures, as such are eco-friendly.  </p>
        <p>SALLY SKOUFIS partners with sustainable freshwater pearl farmers, who deeply consider the habitat for the mussels and diligently meet the ideal conditions for pearl production and water quality. A process that adds value to the ecosystem. These creatures filter water naturally, by removing heavy metals and nitrogen from the waters surrounding them. Research indicates that pearl farming can improve water quality and the local ecosystem, with positive impacts on coral reef conservation. </p>
        <p>A single pearl can take several years to grow. Nurture this phenomenon in mind as you wait patiently for us to lovingly hand make your unique piece. </p>
      </div>
    {% elsif product.metafields.custom.impact == "Exotic Galuchat Leather" %}
        <p class="h5">SALLY SKOUFIS Jewelry: consciously crafted pieces inspired by environmental evolution and sustainable materiality.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Exotic Galuchat leather elegantly featured in this cherished piece is sourced from cooperatives of independent fishermen from the Andaman & South China seas who apply traditional and sustainable processes to capture food - we minimise wastage by using the stunning by-product. To further conserve, SALLY SKOUFIS artisans hand craft each piece adhering to policies established by the Washington Convention on Endangered Species (CITES).</p>
        <p>Sally explores her craft with an opportunity to pioneer and create change, working to continually refine and develop creative and sustainable processes, expressing her designs across all material mediums - a combination of fine, semi-precious and man-made. Her work provides an invitation to be drawn into greater meaning that sits behind the beauty and mystique of its materiality.</p>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="h5">SALLY SKOUFIS Jewelry: consciously crafted pieces inspired by environmental evolution and sustainable materiality.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Sally's designs are inspired by environmental evolution, not led by trend; purpose driven to be worn to occasion, sentiment or self-expression. Her pieces are expressed emotively – working outside the boundaries of a particular genre yet maintaining a signature aesthetic that provokes expectation and boldly captivates.</p>
        <p>Creating pieces that are treasured forever, 'of the earth' as well as 'from the hands of a human', Sally uses ethically sourced precious and semi-precious stones, as well as man-made gemstones. Her selection of materials reflects her persistence to pioneer, honouring with stones that empower. They incite soul connection and provide strength to their wearer with inimitable magnetism.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
      
    <a href="/pages/impact" class="button w-full hidden">Join us to be a part of this evolution</a>
  </div>

  

  <div id="custom-delivery-wrapper" class="custom-popups-wrapper">
